{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "hospedaje-sebastian-collection",
    "name": "🏨 Hospedaje Sebastian API - Complete",
    "description": "# API REST para Sistema de Gestión Hotelera\n\n## 🚀 Características\n- Autenticación JWT automática\n- Tests automáticos en cada request\n- Variables de entorno configurables\n- Documentación completa\n\n## 📋 Uso\n1. Importa el entorno `Hospedaje_Sebastian_Environment.json`\n2. Ejecuta Login para obtener token automáticamente\n3. Los demás requests usarán el token guardado\n\n## 🔗 Base URL\n`{{baseUrl}}` = http://localhost:3000/api\n\n---\n**Versión:** 2.0.0 | **Fecha:** 2026-02-26",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{authToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Pre-request global script",
          "console.log('🚀 Ejecutando request a:', pm.request.url.toString());",
          "",
          "// Verificar si hay token guardado",
          "const token = pm.environment.get('authToken');",
          "if (!token && !pm.request.url.toString().includes('/auth/')) {",
          "    console.warn('⚠️ No hay token de autenticación. Ejecuta Login primero.');",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Test global script",
          "pm.test('✅ Status code válido (2xx o 3xx)', function () {",
          "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200, 399);",
          "});",
          "",
          "pm.test('⏱️ Response time razonable (< 2000ms)', function () {",
          "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(2000);",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
